{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79418,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"653b9567cfc977875bd4a17c632168c4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1901525\" timestamp=\"1438207263\"]\nThe Grand Sirenis also has a facebook group and lots from the UK!\n\n$800 is stupid! I mean I only paid $500 for my dress for crying out loud!  I think for my DIY invites we paid around $35! hahah!\n\nYou aren&#039;t cheap, you are smart![\/quote]Yeah I think I spent $45 for all mine, including all the supplies I didn&#039;t have like paper punchers and things like that.","Attachments":[],"Id":1901596,"PostDate":1438257264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 29 July 2015 - 06:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>The Grand Sirenis also has a facebook group and lots from the UK!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>$800 is stupid! I mean I only paid $500 for my dress for crying out loud! \u00a0I think for my DIY invites we paid around $35! hahah!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You aren't cheap, you are smart!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yeah I think I spent $45 for all mine, including all the supplies I didn't have like paper punchers and things like that.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.186.135.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79418,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"645801735d6ba6140667e3cf11ee4ad3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Glad to hear I&#039;m not cheap!&amp;nbsp; I was literally laughing out loud.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve never had invitations made before, and I know all things wedding related tend to be inflated in price so I thought maybe it was normal!&amp;nbsp; I have all next week off, so I&#039;m going to try to buckle down and bang these out.&amp;nbsp; I borrowed the giant paper cutter from work, I&#039;m skeptical that it will cut with enough precision, but I&#039;m going to try.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;With the design I&#039;m having difficulty putting an image behind and still having it show up.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll fight with that over the weekend.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901616,"PostDate":1438271649,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Glad to hear I'm not cheap!\u00a0 I was literally laughing out loud.\u00a0 I've never had invitations made before, and I know all things wedding related tend to be inflated in price so I thought maybe it was normal!\u00a0 I have all next week off, so I'm going to try to buckle down and bang these out.\u00a0 I borrowed the giant paper cutter from work, I'm skeptical that it will cut with enough precision, but I'm going to try.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>With the design I'm having difficulty putting an image behind and still having it show up.\u00a0 I'll fight with that over the weekend.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread (Grand Sirenis 05.12.16)<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/<\/a><p><br><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wSWQNi0\/weight.png\" alt=\"weight.png\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20160512\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f153\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424042509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1441196917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79418,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"efbb8f0e721fa9bb436d142ff19ab4ce","RawContent":"Good luck. Please post when you are done :)\n\nHahah I brought our paper cutter home from work often. I found it worked much better than the cheaper ones I had bought from michaels. \n\nFor my boarding passes I just cut a straight edge I didn&#039;t round the corners. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1901632,"PostDate":1438331680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good luck. Please post when you are done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br>\nHahah I brought our paper cutter home from work often. I found it worked much better than the cheaper ones I had bought from michaels. <br>\nFor my boarding passes I just cut a straight edge I didn't round the corners. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79418,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91db40d161d568c036da10e3dcc9edaa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JoannaBanana\"] There&#039;s an online store called Paper Garden (I think that&#039;s it). I used them when we got married 4 years ago and their paper prices are amazing! They also have the fold over envelopes as well as the special square size ones that would work for passport and boarding pass invites. I found the link&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.paper-garden.ca&#039;&gt;www.paper-garden.ca&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; You can order \"chips\" of the paper styles and colours to see what you like. They&#039;re pricing is great and since it&#039;s Canada they&#039;ll use priority post to send so you aren&#039;t paying US shipping costs.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901643,"PostDate":1438339630,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282128\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282128-joannabanana\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JoannaBanana<\/span><\/a> There's an online store called Paper Garden (I think that's it). I used them when we got married 4 years ago and their paper prices are amazing! They also have the fold over envelopes as well as the special square size ones that would work for passport and boarding pass invites. I found the link\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.paper-garden.ca' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.paper-garden.ca<\/a>\u00a0 You can order \"chips\" of the paper styles and colours to see what you like. They're pricing is great and since it's Canada they'll use priority post to send so you aren't paying US shipping costs.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79418,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":9,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e9534651a51c37b462ab72856686932","RawContent":"Need a break, I&#039;ve been working hard at these invitations.  I took some action shots for you guys.  \n\n\n\n","Attachments":[],"Id":1901838,"PostDate":1438716395,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Need a break, I've been working hard at these invitations.  I took some action shots for you guys.  <br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901838]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-282128-143873065792.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1438730656786.jpg -  841.08KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/p